---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title={`Terms of Use | ${SITE.brand}`}
  description={`Terms of use for ${SITE.brand}: free online tools provided as-is, processed in your browser. Please read before using the site.`}
  h1="Terms of Use"
  path="/terms"
  updated="[TODO: date]"
>
  <p>
    By using {SITE.brand} (<span>{SITE.domain}</span>) you agree to these terms. If you do not
    agree, please do not use the site.
  </p>

  <h2>The service</h2>
  <p>
    The site provides free online tools that run in your web browser. We may change, add or
    remove tools at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>Your files and content</h2>
  <p>
    You keep all rights to the files and text you process. Because processing happens on your
    device, we do not receive or store your files. You are responsible for making sure you
    have the right to use and modify the files you work with.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>
    Do not use the site for anything unlawful, and do not try to disrupt or overload it.
  </p>

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    The tools are provided "as is", without any warranty. We work to make results accurate,
    but we do not guarantee that any output, calculation or conversion is correct or suitable
    for a particular purpose. Check important results yourself, and always follow the official
    requirements of the organization you are submitting a document or photo to. Calculator
    results, including BMI, are for general information and are not professional, academic or
    medical advice. Keep a copy of your original files.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent allowed by law, we are not liable for any loss or damage arising from your
    use of the site, including lost data or rejected applications.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party links</h2>
  <p>
    The site may link to other websites. We are not responsible for their content or policies.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms. The new version will be posted on this page with a new date.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law and contact</h2>
  <p>
    <span class="placeholder">[TODO: governing law / country]</span>. Questions:
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
